1
00:00:03,403 --> 00:00:08,463
(Raj:)So anyway, last night on video chat, I spent,
like, 20 minutes just staring into Lucy's eyes.

2
00:00:08,641 --> 00:00:12,131
(Leonard:)- That sounds romantic.
- It was, until I realized the screen had frozen.

3
00:00:13,880 --> 00:00:16,210
(Raj:)Still one of my top three dates of all time.

4
00:00:16,583 --> 00:00:18,553
So we ever gonna hang out with this girl?

5
00:00:18,718 --> 00:00:21,988
Ahh, I'd love that, but she's not
really comfortable around people.

6
00:00:22,155 --> 00:00:26,815
(Sheldon:)Yeah, I used to be uncomfortable
around people, but then I learned a trick.

7
00:00:26,993 --> 00:00:31,223
(Sheldon:)I pretend everyone I meet
is a beloved character from Star Trek.

8
00:00:32,565 --> 00:00:33,895
How's that working for you?

9
00:00:34,067 --> 00:00:37,397
(Sheldon:)Oh, like a charm,
unnamed crewman in a red shirt.

10
00:00:38,738 --> 00:00:41,608
Leonard, I may have gotten you ajob.

11
00:00:42,208 --> 00:00:46,438
- I have ajob.
- Yes, he does. He caters to my every whim.

12
00:00:47,080 --> 00:00:51,240
(Howard:)No, in a couple of weeks, Stephen Hawking's
team is sending an expedition...

13
00:00:51,418 --> 00:00:54,578
(Howard:)...to the North Sea to test
hydrodynamic simulations of black holes.

14
00:00:54,754 --> 00:00:58,814
(Howard:)One of their experimental physicists
dropped out and I recommended you.

15
00:00:59,592 --> 00:01:01,522
(Leonard:)Well, do you really think I have a shot?

